{"kind":"rss","id":"wxmp:channel:gh_0b0b1747bf15","title":"天融信阿尔法实验室","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497123&idx=1&sn=cfd39d346153ede80330af078230b598&chksm=cf987d893d616a7acbb16d45372e1fb83455b42199b219ca64e6e3aad8fcc3815caf27faa72d&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"天融信阿尔法实验室将不定期推出技术研究新方向成果，专注安全攻防前沿技术","language":"zh-cn","extra":{"view":"timeline","show_thumbnails":true,"proxy_images":true,"headers":{"referer":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"tags":["微信公众号"]},"author":{"name":"天融信阿尔法实验室","uri":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/"},"image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fwx.qlogo.cn%2Fmmhead%2FQ3auHgzwzM7BcpbVhdGzLaXuSfCBg1ibBPaUxKfWoowOeEI1kibicrpHw%2F0","updated":"2026-11-19T05:29:06.000Z","items":[{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497123:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于nginx多个远程代码执行漏洞(nginx2root)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497123&idx=1&sn=cfd39d346153ede80330af078230b598&chksm=cf987d893d616a7acbb16d45372e1fb83455b42199b219ca64e6e3aad8fcc3815caf27faa72d&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到F5/NGINX官方发布了NGINX Plus和NGINX开源版（NGINX Open Source）的安全更新，修复了5个未经身份验证的远程攻击者可触发的工作进程内存破坏漏洞，可导致敏感信息泄露、拒绝服务或远程代码执行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTgiawm0ib2KZHHGUJYzEAErOXUfiaFicvgfVuvOUWhibTM7VCjqYHzGFUm7arFNVwApZvfA4OeiadfOctjLfIGlzyNO2SV1OUZXHBMo%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-19T05:29:06.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497113:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于OpenJDK Base64解码器远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-114938(Java4Shell)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497113&idx=1&sn=c0de90433b6d9fccf882b656fa96f850&chksm=cf33ae79ba7bd6d6e4a3ed5b0dca1b6a1b23266a09d41d1dc7f4c026823fcf38f3f1c41da6b3&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到OpenJDK修复了一个远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-114938，该漏洞被称为Java4Shell。未经身份验证的远程攻击者可通过向OpenJDK Base64解码器提交特制输入，触发整数下溢及堆越界写，从而实现敏感信息泄露、拒绝服务或远程代码执行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTNMFmCeq28SuwvzF1XYAZVHIoGOHMH6DiceVPpeibTDiboDvXSLPEGkibwnK1kLHP7YiaqUACOOiblgKibiczKDiczzPVbOvx5srYdIHWE%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-18T04:28:30.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497107:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于Apache HTTP Server远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-119618的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497107&idx=1&sn=e7b5c4e9dd5120cb748b91ebfe1bea70&chksm=cf5bd8017d38802eb941def5d54431527f3c27c401e73aa0788690854aabb7919bb39e8a2224&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，阿尔法实验室监测到Apache HTTP Server的HTTP/2模块（mod_http2）存在一处严重的堆破坏漏洞（CVE-2026-119618）。攻击者通过构造并发HTTP/2请求，触发assign_headers()竞态条件，造成堆破坏；Apache与Red Hat将其定为远程代码执行漏洞。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTIFWUOsJgJbfOVBZKR8aM2z0smuLRSlbnuicekzL6otXbHDSpKrU4T0hHArc0Pu2A87M0J5OYzia9Gq5ia1mqOQTedt9I7T0TicrI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-13T09:08:33.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497101:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于OpenSSH musl密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497101&idx=1&sn=e98d607078b3d6b45215bf751074226a&chksm=cfb4b77961da4faf2b078f4142a709bb2dd8d488dac0f1854e996bc748d3452169771a582937&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"天融信阿尔法实验室监测到OpenSSH修复了一个密码认证绕过漏洞CVE-2026-123158，该漏洞被称为sshole。影响由musl libc编译的OpenSSH，远程未授权攻击者无需任何有效凭据即可通过SSH密码认证登录仅允许密钥登录或已锁定密码的账户。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qRHGwhL7ztSlibng9KbOw1e5UWkNOp8mpia1TjtHs7WBmTUwibFEf6dLFYedKs7hwzdLQjtWOYNM9jqTmPrHYx1IOV2mmXYcbuVJQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-06T06:52:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497101:2","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于WordPress核心远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-119977的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497101&idx=2&sn=3ee499d893b2da26087356d16e89ce51&chksm=cfec1f17ba0fee862761c67309e763029d4d29a0336ec149e2b247847e6579baba5bb5d79d69&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"CVE-2026-119977是WordPress核心中的一个远程代码执行漏洞，无需身份认证、无需用户交互。且已有在野利用证据，风险较高。请所有WordPress用户立即开展排查和处置。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTia8mLkUo4B5ILj5gNkUqxtcer2VZAoDWAOhBgFJNmtjibvNTGyza0uwjmNyxQ0Z6qnctQNuPR2ZJbVe7THHQLUNMpDB7jwTpwY%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-06T06:52:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497092:1","title":"【风险提示-已复现】天融信关于Linux Kernel IPv4 TCP远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-98432)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497092&idx=1&sn=bd09620dcce63ddc5f2d75b1b8cdb027&chksm=cfd450621e144f4330afa2737418d90851ded4525a7889bd7492c75c01985020389587544f1b&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"Linux 内核 CVE-2026-98432 远程代码执行漏洞中攻击者可发送特制数据包，无权限获取 root 权限；该漏洞源于 IPv4 TCP 三次握手的竞态条件，利用竞争条件难度较高，目前漏洞细节与 PoC 已公开，部分主流发行版放出补丁，仍建议受影响用户及时做好防御。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qR89XoMgTTxibicibA26K62KOyqjkH0JOKHV4FaxRJnUpxEkAKFqibs3I5KkcfWtPpIspRVEVGmvDQMyJWEF0foYcwtkyGaJeKSbMM%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-04T13:36:59.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497087:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于Node.js Brotli解码器远程代码执行漏洞(CVE-2026-111497)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497087&idx=1&sn=8dcdf5d20033d43ab0ae6337b7ae0905&chksm=cfd1c359285032c9527cb290d8cb6b51cf79b32ab09a560228ae63c74d2a01899176523b4e71&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"Node.js内置的 Brotli 解码器存在一个缺陷，在处理格式错误的压缩数据时，可能向内部缓冲区边界之外写入数据。建议所有受漏洞影响版本的用户，立即启动针对该漏洞的防御工作。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qSvnaiaUxZJNicwuOnbKrTha5iaKBHySKukARwwc0icFBaS0YQ66SHUy1Squib7wMOHf75Q6EofbI73e2FxPjAwvHXOFcVliakWy9Niao%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-23T15:53:19.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497078:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于PHP远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-109618/CVE-2026-109619(PHP2Shell)的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497078&idx=1&sn=b27d53a738e6e7375ed18aa65f60a4a0&chksm=cff48d924a0f7e8be69a3d0f2f4c5c9bc00c6259539abd4d01dd166e4d621956c5d1488e5a68&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到PHP官方发布紧急安全发布预告，PHP核心存在两个严重远程代码执行漏洞CVE-2026-109618、CVE-2026-109619（社区称PHP2Shell），PHP安全团队对两个漏洞的CVSS v4.0评分均为9.2。请相关用户清查资产，并在补丁发布后第一时间升级。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qSF1B3ibua0GwfG3wngicfxII11xwMb34b8UgJGjuQgl4Z3cKwxYxxU48xFq94zvM6tQRKzxqh7pDRhRhN6YCwwuCGE1ZhaHGBTQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-10-21T11:14:03.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497072:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于 Fastjson 1.2.83 默认配置下远程代码执行漏洞的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497072&idx=1&sn=8fca263a9a6d7154f01c872f45eeda83&chksm=cf046ebeb3ec2b10b88c36cbbd696a5ea87162b9cdf2c1edabd081bdd4f43965edf32df4db06&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，阿尔法实验室监测到安全研究员 Kirill Firsov (@k_firsov) 公开披露 Fastjson 1.x 末代版本存在一处严重的远程代码执行漏洞。该漏洞影响面极大，建议受影响用户尽快开展资产排查并采取升级修复或临时缓解措施。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qR7FnLmKibhatWmicEoCCuPdMuF2D7kmBVP6Ou8wdrKe4AekvTLqvDJammPpP8zNyUiabNglr8CzMwbGrPiciauaxFySibwT0W86w2HQ%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-07-21T10:27:07.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247497065:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于WordPress Core预认证远程代码执行漏洞链wp2shell（CVE-2026-63030）的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247497065&idx=1&sn=96b10823e37a18659b50ab9166138d92&chksm=cf5e74b823be3cc7e0f96287760b5a5d39c85f18aa0dc23cecaac85affe06a903bc7f79acfb8&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，WordPress 官方修复了 WordPress Core 中存在的预认证远程代码执行漏洞链，该漏洞链被安全研究人员命名为“wp2shell”，由CVE-2026-63030和CVE-2026-60137两个独立漏洞组合形成，可被串联利用以实现针对WordPress站点的预认证远程代码执行。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qTPKib9VQuHfPf1366AAFAb3MHpk5nEhF9dfYoz9GawZThngFm3wGI5gHOiaRzicab038hBl5hsahooLTNsUujZLwx1pnKVyr2Oic0%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-07-20T07:22:39.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw%3D%3D:2247496951:1","title":"【风险提示】天融信关于防范AI编程工具Claude Code安全后门隐患的风险提示","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=Mzg3MDAzMDQxNw==&mid=2247496951&idx=1&sn=20eb03bc0168453f0541829356828612&chksm=cf42c155fb479bf3036beef1ccb2460ecc1c30d84a1fc860e2c40e9a0392d413a8951075b99c&scene=126&sessionid=1795146061#rd","description":"近日，天融信阿尔法实验室监测到Anthropic开发的AI编程工具Claude Code存在安全后门隐患，该后门最初由Reddit网站上的LegitMichel777用户公开。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FTWq54w4h0qQhDJuaSKWjL5icupjTOwqnicHpHMTHrIHtKjoPfQBRwVha3sMEHia01S3gXIyJO76xicNDam4Ud7ibTYpucm69JLxOQyXTCaHTHrQs%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-07-09T10:49:28.000Z"}]}